| livekit-agents 1.7.1          | Apache-2.0| Realtime transport, turn handling           |
| livekit-plugins-rime 1.7.1    | Apache-2.0| Rime TTS adapter (judged spoken output)     |
| livekit-plugins-deepgram      | Apache-2.0| Streaming STT                               |
| livekit-plugins-openai        | Apache-2.0| LLM adapter                                 |
| livekit-plugins-silero        | Apache-2.0| Silero VAD (model has its own license terms)|
| livekit-client (npm)          | Apache-2.0| Browser room + data channel                 |
